integer OR float literal. This was originally brought up here: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101926\r\n\r\nIf this gets a green light I'll also take a stab at shoring up the docs to see if there's improvements to be made around \"constant\" vs \"literal\".\r\n\r\nBefore:\r\n![Godot_v4 4-beta1_win64_Cq0W3xbX6Z](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/43dba1ff-3f53-43de-b18a-a402592ddf54)\r\n\r\nAfter:\r\n![godot windows editor dev x86_64_MLxbNq5qr4](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1731c45c-ab99-46fb-abc1-94b3860cbe54)\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"maxpiepenbrink","id":240875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MDg3NQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/240875?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxpiepenbrink","html_url":"https://github.com/maxpiepenbrink","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxpiepenbrink/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxpiepenbrink/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxpiepenbrink/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxpiepenbrink/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxpiepenbrink/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxpiepenbrink/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxpiepenbrink/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxpiepenbrink/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxpiepenbrink/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/10